Folder icons from the GNOME Project's Adwaita icon theme
(https://github.com/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme, Adwaita/scalable/places, https://www.gnome.org),
made into sizes and recoloured by xl-Cheeselooks (tools/import-adwaita-places.py):
the folder snapped to whole pixels at 16-48px, colours swapped for yours.
Used under Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 (one of the two
licences GNOME offers; the other is the GNU LGPL v3). GNOME's licence note:

This work is licenced under the terms of either the GNU LGPL v3 or
Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 United States License.

To view a copy of the CC-BY-SA licence, visit
http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/ or send a letter to Creative
Commons, 171 Second Street, Suite 300, San Francisco, California 94105, USA.

When attributing the artwork, using "GNOME Project" is enough.
Please link to http://www.gnome.org where available.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The pictures on the 16, 22 and 24px icons, and on the icons GNOME does not
draw as folders (recent, saved search, network, workgroup), are from Mint-Y
(https://github.com/linuxmint/mint-y-icons), CC BY-SA 4.0, by Sam Hewitt and
Alexey Varfolomeev, placed by tools/import-adwaita-places.py and
tools/compose-missing-places.py.

